   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Cloud Logging API (v2) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Sinks, exclusions, log-based metrics, log buckets and log views are configuration metadata only: no log entry is written, stored, read, routed, excluded, counted or exported, and entries, logs and tail methods are not implemented. Sinks receive no writerIdentity; uniqueWriterIdentity and customWriterIdentity create or use no service account. Filters and destinations are recorded as given and not evaluated or resolved. Log-based metrics support create, get, list and delete; metrics.update and metric names with '/' hierarchy are not implemented. The project's _Default and _Required sinks and buckets are not pre-created. Locking a bucket is refused. Deleted buckets are removed immediately rather than kept 7 days in DELETE_REQUESTED, undelete and asynchronous bucket methods are not implemented, and a bucket with views cannot be deleted. Folder, organization and billing-account parents are not implemented.",
   "name": "Cloud Logging"
  }
 ],
